  "solution": {
    "text": "We know&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.<p>Where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;is upper bound of value of any random variable and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is lower bound of any random variable,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>25</mn></math>, (removed equality sign because&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>&#963;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>From given options&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#963;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>6</mn></math>.</p>",
